        "height": 190,
        "content": "## Complaint Journey Replay\n**Demo replay: production portals call the hub directly.**\nReporter 1 files on the RB portal, reporter 2 on the PGRC portal, both about the clean college SYN-0040. The hub finds the cross-bureau overlap and returns it in `alerts_created`; the IF node sends it to Telegram.\nBefore a run: `python reset_demo.py`. Edit URLs and the Telegram chat ID in the **Settings** node (inside Docker use host.docker.internal instead of localhost)."
      }
